{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1240244-second-resurgence-faking-alien-life","id":1240244,"title":"Second Resurgence: Faking Alien Life","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-29T16:48:01-07:00","id":1240244,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Second Resurgence: Faking Alien Life","content":"So the moon landing was a renaissance plus for the Fae so what about if the Fae planned to arrange another glamour resurgence. The obvious choice is to reveal the supernatural, they don't need to reveal changelings exist, they could just screw over vampires. But they may not want to do that to avoid themselves being outed, or retribution.<br /> <br /> So what if they decide to fake alien life? So say Concordia or even an alliance of Kingdoms work on a massive plan to spike curiosity of alien, likely intelligent life? They could do a number of things.<br /> <br /> They could fake Seti messages.<br /> <br /> They could work to block off or confuse certain starlights to make it seem like an artificial object is obstructing a star, possibly convincing others of a Dyson Swarm like structure.<br /> <br /> They could fake some artifacts in some ancient newly opened tombs seemingly of alien origin, like using naming and Metamorphosis to create an uncanny metal and Chronos to age it. And faking some sculptures or paintings to indicate an ancient aliens encounter.<br /> <br /> <br /> They could fake an alien capsule on the Moon in preparation for the next moonlanding.<br /> <br /> They could construct a temple on Mars that either await the upcoming Mars Mission, mirroring the Moonlanding in spirit, or fake a meteor landing on mars uncovering a hidden structure as well as the meteor itself seemingly of alien origin.<br /> <br /> <br /> So what would the consequences of such another Resurgence? Would even more Trods open up? Would Arcadia be re-opened? Would it just Create/Reveal new Alien Fae and Kiths? Would More and More Freeholds and Glens start returning/popping up? Would new houses return, each with their own stories? Or just reinforcements from Arcadia? Would the Higher Hunting Ground Return? Would Banality be lessened? Would there be any new metaphysics?<br /> <br /> Who wouldn't benefit?<br /> <br /> And depending on the plans, and they could actually work on a multi decade plan to pull off all of these. It would also probably kick off a tech race for space travel.<br /> <br /> <br /> Its a good excuse to have Changelings in SPAAAAAAAAAAaaaaace....<br /> <br /> <br /> Who would be likely canidates to spearhead this? The Concordians? The Nunnehi Nation? Maybe even the Merfolk as a desperate last ditch attempt to keep banality at bay by opening up a new frontier. Or even Inanimae as they likely could exist in space?<br /> <br /> <br /> What do you think about Fae off of Earth, do you think some of the space fae could still be more like Dark Age Fae and would thus have to convert into the new fae templates like the Menehune and Nunnehi adapting? Or the Inanimae becoming modern Inanimae? Or do you think they would be totally Different? Maybe instead of the Seasonal Courts they have some sort of stellar/sidereal/astral courts?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T13:00:53-07:00","id":1240554,"title":"","content":"Thematically I don't think Fae should be able to fake things like this. Under the &quot;light' of banality your &quot;Temple&quot; on mars just proves to be a wierd trick of shadows. The &quot;alien&quot; pod gets lost or gets easily proven to be a fake. The seti signals..gets another &quot;obvious&quot; explanation. I don't think Glimerings or Ressurgences can be built on the back of pure changeling lies or.. they would be doing it constantly?<br /> <br /> If you're going to pull an Ozymandius I think you need to go abit more crossovery. That's just my opinion. Now a world where someone DID pull it off could be an interesting Changeling story<br /> <br /> <br /> As for the Fae of the Stars...<br /> <br /> Before the touch of man there were wild monsters, nightmare beings that we have countless names for... Jotun, Titans, but the word the Kithain call them most commonly is Formorian. These were the wild and primal aspects of the Dreaming. And they were brought low by the Shining Ones.<br /> <br /> So what is the void but the place most untouched by Man? A place of primal danger and horror... a place that has no desire to be shaped by the Tuathan Dream or Banality, a place of twisted horrors that seeks to spread madness and destroy humanity. So changelings vs lovecraftian style horrors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T23:10:12-07:00","id":1240730,"title":"","content":"That is only if you do it with brainwash tricks, I\u2019m talking about falsifying evidence which won\u2019t get erased by mists. So if you go on epic dreaming voyage to take a trod to mars and build a secret catacomb on Mars, you know out of actual stones, then that just creates nutzo dreamfuel when the world finds out. Thing is you need to prevent conspiracies from covering it up, so arrange for things like live reveals, which the technocracy at least has safeties built around for, but many other conspiracies like the Cam would not likely be able to stop.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-01T14:08:11-07:00","id":1241486,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1240244-second-resurgence-faking-alien-life?p=1240730#post1240730\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is only if you do it with brainwash tricks, I\u2019m talking about falsifying evidence which won\u2019t get erased by mists. So if you go on epic dreaming voyage to take a trod to mars and build a secret catacomb on Mars, you know out of actual stones, then that just creates nutzo dreamfuel when the world finds out. Thing is you need to prevent conspiracies from covering it up, so arrange for things like live reveals, which the technocracy at least has safeties built around for, but many other conspiracies like the Cam would not likely be able to stop.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I am of the vast opinion that in a world where they couldn't prove Fairies exist, they couldn't successfully fake Alien Life. This is a world filled with MULTIPLE bigfoots that actually exist, multiple realms that actually exist an actual conspiracy of vampires and multiple Proofs of actual alien life in various forms. Creating a full pyramid on Mars isn't going to do much in the face of those Mage constructed Pyramids or the Face. They couldn't even successfully fake fairies existing.<br /> <br /> SOme wierd structure on Mars/Moon/etc isn't going to matter. Some Weird signal is either going to be too obviously faked or meaningless. The only way people would believe in alien life that it matters would be the full Ozymandius. Have Aliens show up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T05:30:52-07:00","id":1241772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1240244-second-resurgence-faking-alien-life#post1240244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The obvious choice is to reveal the supernatural, they don't need to reveal changelings exist, they could just screw over vampires. But they may not want to do that to avoid themselves being outed, or retribution.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd love to see how vampires pull that off in the Dreaming setting.<br /> <br /> &quot;You have a problem with us, but not the 7 foot tall, blue skinned guy with horns!?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Uhhh, who are you talking about?&quot; *sees a perfectly normal human*<br /> <br /> <br /> On a related note, the Sluagh might be able to help in this regard, as the pale skin and black eyes could be used to impersonate The Grays.<br /> <br /> As for the idea of alien themed courts, I feel that would also be plausible. Seeing as how our general conceptions about alien life is that they are members of some kind of galactic empire, or a federation of planets. So having their own noble titles, or social hierarchy makes sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 08-02-2018, 08:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}